{"id": "Ugxy4rNBssKAh6VuKVN4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 9, "text": "플레이리스트 무드로 완성된 이번 앨범은 2026.05.08 (금) 정식 발매 예정입니다 🖤\n플랫폼별 공개 시간은 상이할 수 있으며, 유통사 및 서비스 상황에 따라 일정이 변동될 수 있습니다.\n여러분의 일상에 자연스럽게 스며들 순간을 기대해주세요.\n\n\nThis playlist-inspired album is scheduled for \nofficial release on May 8, 2026 (Fri) 🖤  \nRelease times may vary by platform,  \nand the schedule is subject to change \ndepending on distribution and service conditions.  \nWe hope it finds its way naturally into your everyday moments.  \n\n──────\n\n🎧Track list\n00:00 - 01. Own Your Day\n03:00 - 02. Inside Joke\n06:08 - 03. Left Behind\n09:47 - 04. Hate Me More\n13:25 - 05. Care Control\n16:45 - 06. Half Beat\n20:10 - 07. Look Good Still\n23:29 - 08. Room Museum\n27:07 - 09. Wrong Feels Right\n30:23 - 10. Trace Loop\n33:59 - 11. Unsent Text\n36:48 - 12. Clearer Now\n40:30 - 13. Saved Name\n44:15 - 14. Loop Voice\n47:32 - 15. Same Season\n50:45  - ∙∙∙ Repeat ∙∙∙", "published": "2026-05-04T06:20:43", "replies": 0, "creator": true}
